  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "The goal is for each team member to learn what to do when obstacles emerge that prevent successful teamwork.\n\n### Interdependencies\n\nTeams not only work with each other, they often also work with other teams. Other team members or entire teams can slow down or impede your team from reaching your goals. Building strong communication skills within and across teams can help the team overcome these obstacles. Consider these options:\n\nTalk to your manager or team leader 1 on 1 about issues you are having.\n\nReach out to other teams, leaders, or individuals and ask for specific dates that you should expect deliverables. \n\n### Keep the lines of communication open\n\nTry to maintain the lines of communication even when there are no obstacles with progress updates and regular reminders. This will make it easier to bring up issues when and if they occur.",
